\hoja{data/tests.csv}
The specimens were tested at \celda{C2}~days. The column of strengths
(B2:B6) is placed as a row with \texttt{[T]}:

\begin{table}[H]
  \centering
  \caption{Compressive strength of the specimens (MPa).}
  \begin{tabular}{ccccc}
    \toprule
    \celda[T]{A2:A6} \\
    \midrule
    \celda[T]{B2:B6} \\
    \bottomrule
  \end{tabular}
\end{table}

Nulla vitae elit libero, a pharetra augue. If you change a strength in
\texttt{tests.csv} and compile, the table changes.
